**Here are the best RAM value guides, cheat codes, and resources for watching (e.g., emulators like BizHawk/bsnes), modding/hacking, and cheats for Donkey Kong Country SNES (US/NTSC). Focus is on WRAM (7E0000-7E1FFF), the main game RAM. Addresses work in most debuggers/cheat engines. Rev 1.0 and Rev 2 have slight differences—test your ROM (SHA1: C946DCA0 for v1.0 US).**

### 1. **Comprehensive WRAM Address List (from Verified Cheats)**
GameHacking.org's database is the **gold standard**—extracted ~40 unique addresses from "Standard" codes (direct RAM pokes). Use these for Cheat Engine (with bsnes core), BizHawk Lua/RAM Search, snes9x-tyran RAM watch, or hacking scripts. All for **US v1.0** (similar for Rev 2).

| Category | Hex Address | Description / Cheat Example |
