**Full Database (300+ codes):** [GameHacking v1.0](https://gamehacking.org/game/42704), [Rev 2](https://gamehacking.org/game/42701). Search "Standard" for raw RAM pokes.

**Data Crystal Stub Map:** Only 7E003E = Current Level (worlds 1-6, levels 1-~7). 

### 2. **TAS / RAM Watching Files**
- **DKC.wch (BizHawk/snes9x-rr RAM Watch):** "Useful addresses" by TASer Tompa. Load directly—includes frame rules, positions, speeds for glitching/TAS/modding. **Download:** [TASVideos](https://tasvideos.org/UserFiles/Game/132) (search "DKC.wch").

**Tips:** BizHawk > Tools > RAM Watch > Import .wch. Great for live monitoring (e.g., X/Y pos ~7E00B4/00B6 DK).

### 3. **Cheat Codes (Game Genie / PAR)**
**Top Game Genie (US v1.0 - works in emus/Action Replay):**
| Cheat | Code(s) |
|-------|---------|
| Infinite Lives | C2C9-4E2C + C2C1-4A9C |
| Invincibility | 1DCC-CA7A + 1DCA-C2EA (toggle off if stuck) |
| Moon Jump (All) | EE8F-C273 |
| High Jump (All) | A08F-C273 + A087-C3E3 |
| Infinite Time | (Use RAM 7E137F:00) |
| 999 Bananas | (RAM 7E052C:09 + 7E052D:09) |
| All Levels/Bonuses | 0AB1-1A37 + DDB1-1247 + ... (14 codes, full list on site) |

**Full Lists:** [GameHacking](https://gamehacking.org/game/42704), [GameFAQs GG](https://gamefaqs.gamespot.com/snes/588282-donkey-kong-country/faqs/9885).

**PAR Codes (Pro Action Replay):** [Almar's Guide](https://www.almarsguides.com/retro/walkthroughs/snes/games/donkeykongcountry/proactionreplay) - e.g., 70C0B098 (Inf Lives).

### 4. **ROM Hacking / Modding**
- **DKC Text Editor v0.28:** Edit messages, credits. US compatible. **Download:** [RomHacking Forum](https://www.romhacking.net/forum/index.php?topic=35095.0).
- **ROM Map (Offsets):** [Data Crystal](https://datacrystal.romhacking.net/wiki/Donkey_Kong_Country_(SNES)/ROM_map) - Text, graphics, levels (U v1.0).
- **Hacks:** [RomHacking.net DKC Hacks](https://www.romhacking.net/?page=hacks&platform=9&game=502&category=) - e.g., Competition Edition (10-min run).
- **For ASM/Lua Mods:** Use RAM above + bsnes debugger. SMWCentral thread has partial maps (DKC1 sparse).

**Emu Setup:** BizHawk (TAS/cheats), bsnes-hd (watch 7E in hex viewer), Mesen-S (SNES debugger). Load saves from prev, poke RAM for testing.

